   "message": "Monospace type outside code: JetBrains Mono — e.g. \"Loading...\", \"async function load() { await magic(); }\", \"frontend\", \"backend\"",
   "fix": "Set it in the text face. Monospace is for literal code inside <pre>/<code> only.",
   "alsoAt": [
